WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.078
Welcome to China Toy Atlas.

00:00:02.078 --> 00:00:09.898
This tour shows you how to find blind boxes and squishy toys, read the details we have, and make a useful shortlist.

00:00:09.898 --> 00:00:12.387
You are looking at the actual catalog.

00:00:12.387 --> 00:00:18.075
It is a growing research directory, not a complete list of every product sold in China.

00:00:19.075 --> 00:00:20.910
Start with this week's updates.

00:00:20.910 --> 00:00:24.947
Added to catalog means newly added here, not necessarily newly launched.

00:00:24.947 --> 00:00:28.250
New releases have release dates in the week shown.

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:31.920
Price changes and back in stock refer to tracked shops.

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:37.425
Click a number to see the matching items, and check the last completed update date.

00:00:38.425 --> 00:00:42.159
Choose a retailer or shop to see its own listings.

00:00:42.159 --> 00:00:44.400
Here, select Top Toy's international store.

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:47.761
The results and weekly counts change with your selection.

00:00:47.761 --> 00:00:51.122
The price belongs to the shop and market shown.

00:00:51.122 --> 00:00:56.350
An overseas store price must not be treated as a mainland China retail price.

00:00:57.350 --> 00:01:02.020
Reset the filters, then choose a brand or type a product name.

00:01:02.020 --> 00:01:05.911
In this example, search for Crybaby, Cry Me An Ocean.

00:01:05.911 --> 00:01:11.748
Product cards now put available facts first, such as material, size, character and design options.

00:01:11.748 --> 00:01:15.250
Missing wave numbers are not repeated as empty labels.

00:01:16.250 --> 00:01:17.752
Open Full product details.

00:01:17.752 --> 00:01:22.633
Read the shop description, available dimensions and materials, and follow their source links.

00:01:22.633 --> 00:01:29.015
Expand listed options to compare a single blind box with a full set or a specific character.

00:01:29.015 --> 00:01:32.019
Prices for different packs are not directly comparable.

00:01:32.019 --> 00:01:37.275
Source photographs may show example designs, not the guaranteed contents of one random box.

00:01:38.275 --> 00:01:41.263
The information still to verify is kept separately.

00:01:41.263 --> 00:01:43.131
Missing facts are never guessed.

00:01:43.131 --> 00:01:47.240
A launch date is a release date supported by a source.

00:01:47.240 --> 00:01:51.350
A shop page date is when that retailer published its listing.

00:01:51.350 --> 00:01:52.470
They are different.

00:01:52.470 --> 00:01:57.700
Launches and waves shows supported dates and clearly marked estimates, with the market identified.

00:01:58.700 --> 00:02:03.741
Open Trending and read the reason on the card, not just the badge.

00:02:03.741 --> 00:02:10.720
A reported purchase counter, a dated demand report and a retailer's hot pick are different kinds of evidence.

00:02:10.720 --> 00:02:13.822
Possible product appeal is shown separately as interpretation.

00:02:13.822 --> 00:02:18.475
A shop recommendation does not prove nationwide popularity or measured sales growth.

00:02:19.475 --> 00:02:23.046
Use the bookmark on a product photo to save it.

00:02:23.046 --> 00:02:26.618
Open Shortlist to review your saved items on this device.

00:02:26.618 --> 00:02:32.332
Download C S V exports the filtered list, including available specifications, source links and price options.

00:02:32.332 --> 00:02:36.975
The Full C S V link at the bottom downloads the whole catalog.

00:02:36.975 --> 00:02:39.475
You can open these files in Excel.

00:02:40.475 --> 00:02:46.061
Finally, open Brand coverage and item checks to see what is partial or missing.

00:02:46.061 --> 00:02:48.854
Weekly updates use the same website link.

00:02:48.854 --> 00:02:53.641
Check the actual completed-update date rather than assuming every shop was refreshed.

00:02:53.641 --> 00:03:00.025
Share this as a product-discovery tool, and verify the original listing before making a purchasing decision.
